          "content": "<div style=\"float: right; clear: right; margin: 0 0 1em 1em; width: 250px; border: 1px solid #aaa; background: #f9f9f9; padding: 5px; text-align: left; font-size: 88%;\">\n  <div style=\"background: #fcc; padding: 5px; text-align: center; font-weight: bold;\">Fluorescent Coral Reefs</div>\n  <div style=\"padding: 3px;\">Implementation Type: Project</div>\n  <div style=\"padding: 3px;\">Status: Active Development</div>\n  <div style=\"padding: 3px;\">Related Idea: [[Bioluminescent Organisms]]</div>\n  <div style=\"padding: 3px;\">Category: [[Category:Biology]]</div>\n</div>\n\n<h1>Fluorescent Coral Reefs</h1>\n\n<p>Implementation of bioluminescent organism research for environmental monitoring through engineered coral systems.</p>\n\n<!-- Carousel Container -->\n<div id=\"carousel-container\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 800px; margin: 20px auto; position: relative;\">\n  <!-- Carousel Wrapper -->\n  <div id=\"carousel-wrapper\" style=\"position: relative; overflow: hidden; height: 400px; border: 1px solid #ddd; border-radius: 8px;\">\n    <!-- Slides -->\n    <div class=\"carousel-slide\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #f9f9f9; overflow-y: auto; transition: transform 0.5s ease-in-out;\">\n      <h2>Overview</h2>\n      {{:Fluorescent Coral Reefs/Overview}}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-slide\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 100%; width: 100%; height: 100%; padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #f9f9f9; overflow-y: auto; transition: transform 0.5s ease-in-out;\">\n      <h2>Genetic Engineering</h2>\n      {{:Fluorescent Coral Reefs/Genetic Engineering}}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-slide\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 200%; width: 100%; height: 100%; padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #f9f9f9; overflow-y: auto; transition: transform 0.5s ease-in-out;\">\n      <h2>Environmental Applications</h2>\n      {{:Fluorescent Coral Reefs/Environmental Applications}}\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"carousel-slide\" style=\"position: absolute; top: 0; left: 300%; width: 100%; height: 100%; padding: 20px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #f9f9f9; overflow-y: auto; transition: transform 0.5s ease-in-out;\">\n      <h2>Implementation Challenges</h2>\n      {{:Fluorescent Coral Reefs/Implementation Challenges}}\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Navigation Dots -->\n  <div id=\"carousel-nav\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 15px 0;\">\n    <span class=\"dot active\" onclick=\"currentSlide(1)\" style=\"cursor: pointer; height: 15px; width: 15px; margin: 0 2px; background-color: #bbb; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\"></span>\n    <span class=\"dot\" onclick=\"currentSlide(2)\" style=\"cursor: pointer; height: 15px; width: 15px; margin: 0 2px; background-color: #bbb; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\"></span>\n    <span class=\"dot\" onclick=\"currentSlide(3)\" style=\"cursor: pointer; height: 15px; width: 15px; margin: 0 2px; background-color: #bbb; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\"></span>\n    <span class=\"dot\" onclick=\"currentSlide(4)\" style=\"cursor: pointer; height: 15px; width: 15px; margin: 0 2px; background-color: #bbb; border-radius: 50%; display: inline-block; transition: background-color 0.3s ease;\"></span>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Navigation Arrows -->\n  <a class=\"prev\" onclick=\"plusSlides(-1)\" style=\"cursor: pointer; position: absolute; top: 50%; left: -40px; width: auto; margin-top: -22px; padding: 16px; color: white; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; transition: 0.3s ease; border-radius: 0 3px 3px 0; user-select: none; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">&#10094;</a>\n  <a class=\"next\" onclick=\"plusSlides(1)\" style=\"cursor: pointer; position: absolute; top: 50%; right: -40px; width: auto; margin-top: -22px; padding: 16px; color: white; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18px; transition: 0.3s ease; border-radius: 3px 0 0 3px; user-select: none; background: rgba(0,0,0,0.3);\">&#10095;</a>\n</div>\n\n<script>\n// Carousel functionality\nlet slideIndex = 1;\nshowSlides(slideIndex);\n\nfunction plusSlides(n) {\n  showSlides(slideIndex += n);\n}\n\nfunction currentSlide(n) {\n  showSlides(slideIndex = n);\n}\n\nfunction showSlides(n) {\n  let i;\n  let slides = document.getElementsByClassName(\"carousel-slide\");\n  let dots = document.getElementsByClassName(\"dot\");\n\n  if (n > slides.length) {slideIndex = 1}\n  if (n < 1) {slideIndex = slides.length}\n\n  for (i = 0; i < slides.length; i++) {\n    slides[i].style.transform = \"translateX(\" + (slideIndex - 1) * -100 + \"%)\";\n  }\n\n  for (i = 0; i < dots.length; i++) {\n    dots[i].className = dots[i].className.replace(\" active\", \"\");\n  }\n\n  if (dots[slideIndex-1]) {\n    dots[slideIndex-1].className += \" active\";\n  }\n}\n</script>\n\n<style>\n.carousel-slide h2 {\n  color: #2c5aa0;\n  border-bottom: 2px solid #2c5aa0;\n  padding-bottom: 10px;\n}\n\n.carousel-slide ul, .carousel-slide ol {\n  margin: 10px 0 10px 20px;\n}\n\n.carousel-slide li {\n  margin-bottom: 8px;\n}\n\n.prev:hover, .next:hover {\n  background-color: rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\n}\n</style>\n\n[[Category:Biology]]\n[[Category:Implementations]]\n[[Supports implementation::Fluorescent Coral Reefs]]"
